"test":{"name":"fog-rule-supply-cut-unseen","kind":"rules","opponent":"Human","rounds":"4","check":"supplyCutUnseen","question":"Supply cut by enemies the side does not see (the helicopter case): Blue's supply unit at (-3,0), linked to the HQ, supplies a Blue helicopter at (0,0); six stealthy Red grunts ring the helicopter, cutting it off (a stealthy land unit is not spotted by an aircraft beside it). The screen does not lie: the helicopter's tile shows out of supply and the helicopter unfed, as it truly is; the ring's own tiles show as Blue's supply would be without them (no one-tile hole pinpoints a grunt; a supplied ring round an unsupplied tile is the oddity that says look). No contact: no transit. At Blue's next turn it is not refuelled or rearmed. Also reported, not checked: whether the AI, planning with what it knows, reads the helicopter as resupplied there.","rules":"standard"},
